{"availability":"available","full":"Abdulla1x/Macros-Calculator","name":"Macros-Calculator","description":"A full-stack, multi-user nutrition tracking app: a React + TypeScript PWA backed by a FastAPI + SQLAlchemy REST API on PostgreSQL, with AI meal analysis that shows its uncertainty.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2024-07-16T11:02:43Z","updated":"2026-10-05T19:08:59Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://macros-calculator-mu.vercel.app","topics":["calorie-tracker","fastapi","fitness-tracker","gemini-api","macro-tracker","nutrition-tracker","postgresql","pwa","python","react","typescript"],"demo":"https://macros-calculator-mu.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:59.948Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:59.948Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:59.948Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:59.948Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🔗 Live app: macros-calculator-mu.vercel.app — sign up and start logging. (Free-tier hosting: the first request after idle can take 30–60 s.)","A full-stack, multi-user nutrition tracking app: a React + TypeScript dashboard UI (installable as a PWA) backed by a FastAPI + SQLAlchemy REST API on PostgreSQL.","Log meals by typing an ingredient name — macros auto-fill from your personal food library, with an Open Food Facts lookup as fallback for foods you haven't logged before. Or skip the form entirely: describe your meal, record a voice note, or photograph it — any one is enough — and let AI estimate the macros — with honest uncertainty ranges and editable assumptions — before you review and save. Track calories and protein (plus carbs and fat if you enable them), set daily goals, weigh in, and watch progress rings, trend charts and a computed weekly review update as you log."],"features":["Email + password auth: Argon2id password hashing, JWT bearer tokens (7-day expiry), per-IP rate limiting on login, signup and password reset","Per-user everything: meals, food library, saved meal templates, weight entries, water logs, step counts, supplements and their check-offs, calorie plans, goals/settings, and AI analyses are isolated per account —…","Layered AI quotas: 12 analyses + 16 voice notes + 3 review summaries per user per day, under a global ceiling of 40 calls/day across every account — sized for Gemini's free tier of 20 requests a day per model, and…","What the AI sees: your photos, voice note and description are sent to Google Gemini to estimate the meal, and the app says so beside the Analyze button. Photos are shrunk on your phone first, which also strips their…","Own your data: change your password (revokes all previously issued tokens), download everything as JSON, or permanently delete your account from Settings"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abdulla1x/Macros-Calculator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"265246a30bc767272d4d7a846d5931529771fdbf0b0b06c6c412627a4b6a4e3f","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:00.080Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:00.080Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"🔗 Live app: macros-calculator-mu.vercel.app — sign up and start logging. (Free-tier hosting: the first request after idle can take 30–60 s.)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abdulla1x/Macros-Calculator/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Email + password auth: Argon2id password hashing, JWT bearer tokens (7-day expiry), per-IP rate limiting on login, signup and password reset","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abdulla1x/Macros-Calculator/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Until one is wired up a forgotten password means a lost account, and the signup page says so rather than letting you find out later.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abdulla1x/Macros-Calculator/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","stat